#: sentifyd-avatar.php:386
msgid ""
"This plugin embeds the Sentifyd avatar web component which stores session-scoped data in the browser (sessionStorage) to maintain UI state and conversation context. Keys "
"may include avatar open/closed state, authentication data such as short-lived tokens, and conversation transcript. Data clears when the tab/window closes. No data is "
"stored in cookies or local storage by the widget."
msgstr ""

